---
import MockupIcon from "./MockupIcon.astro";
---
<figure class="briefing" aria-label="Illustrative Wellington daily agent briefing and follow-up">
  <div class="briefing-thread">
    <div class="briefing-exchange">
      <div class="briefing-user" role="group" aria-label="You">
        <p>What needs my attention today?</p>
      </div>

      <div class="wc-card briefing-reply" role="group" aria-label="Wellington">
        <div class="briefing-heading">
          <span class="briefing-mark"><img src="/wellington/mark.svg" alt="" width="25" height="25" /></span>
          <h3>One folder needs review.</h3>
        </div>
        <div class="briefing-decision briefing-decision-meeting">
          <span class="briefing-decision-icon"><MockupIcon name="file" /></span>
          <div>
            <strong>Weekly operations report</strong>
            <p>Uses the folder proposed for archive</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <p>The cleanup agent had permission to archive it. The weekly operations report still pulls from it, so Wellington held that folder and sent the decision to the report owner.</p>
        <footer class="briefing-audit">
          <span id="briefing-audit-label">Tools and audit history</span>
          <ul class="briefing-sources" aria-labelledby="briefing-audit-label">
            <li>Archive request</li>
            <li>Report dependency</li>
            <li>Action held</li>
          </ul>
        </footer>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="briefing-exchange">
      <div class="briefing-user" role="group" aria-label="You">
        <p>Keep that folder in place and continue with the eligible ones.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="wc-card briefing-reply" role="group" aria-label="Wellington">
        <div class="briefing-heading">
          <span class="briefing-mark"><img src="/wellington/mark.svg" alt="" width="25" height="25" /></span>
          <h3>Folder left in place</h3>
        </div>
        <p>The weekly operations report can still use the folder.</p>
        <div class="briefing-decision briefing-decision-policy">
          <span class="briefing-decision-icon"><MockupIcon name="file" /></span>
          <div>
            <strong>35 folders cleared for archiving</strong>
            <p>4 folders still fall within the 90-day window</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</figure>

<style>
  .briefing {
    margin: 0;
    padding: clamp(16px, 4.4vw, 64px);
    border-radius: 24px;
    position: relative;
    isolation: isolate;
    background: #2c2334;
    color: #fff;
  }

  .briefing::before {
    content: "";
    position: absolute;
    inset: 0;
    z-index: -1;
    border-radius: inherit;
    background:
      linear-gradient(145deg, #25123255, #1a102a70),
      url('/wellington/briefing-texture.webp') center / cover;
    background-blend-mode: multiply;
    filter: hue-rotate(53deg);
  }

  .briefing-thread {
    display: grid;
    gap: clamp(24px, 4vw, 56px);
    max-width: 1060px;
    margin-inline: auto;
  }

  .briefing-exchange {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-rows: subgrid;
    grid-row: span 2;
    gap: 16px;
    min-width: 0;
  }

  .briefing-user {
    align-self: end;
    justify-self: end;
    width: fit-content;
    max-width: 100%;
    padding: 10px 16px;
    border-radius: 12px 12px 3px 12px;
    background: #24152f99;
    box-shadow: inset 0 1px 0 #ffffff24;
  }

  .briefing-user p,
  .briefing-reply p {
    margin: 0;
    font-size: 1rem;
    line-height: 1.5;
    text-wrap: pretty;
  }

  .briefing-reply {
    --wc-surface: #fff;
    --wc-line: #fff;
    --wc-ink: #28212d;
    display: grid;
    align-content: start;
    gap: 16px;
  }

  .briefing-heading {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 10px;
  }

  .briefing-mark {
    display: grid;
    place-items: center;
    flex: none;
    width: 36px;
    height: 36px;
    border-radius: 8px;
  }

  .briefing-heading h3 {
    margin: 0;
    font-size: clamp(1.25rem, 2.1vw, 1.75rem);
    line-height: 1.15;
    letter-spacing: -.03em;
    font-weight: 500;
    text-wrap: balance;
  }

  .briefing-decision {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: auto minmax(0, 1fr);
    align-items: start;
    gap: 12px;
    padding: 12px;
    border: 1px solid var(--decision-line);
    border-radius: 9px;
    background: var(--decision-surface);
    color: #28212d;
    font-size: .9375rem;
    line-height: 1.4;
  }

  .briefing-decision-meeting {
    --decision-line: #dce4e5;
    --decision-surface: #f1f5f4;
    --decision-icon-surface: #dcebe7;
    --decision-ink: #2f5a51;
  }

  .briefing-decision-policy {
    --decision-line: #e7dce9;
    --decision-surface: #f6f0f6;
    --decision-icon-surface: #eaddf0;
    --decision-ink: #65456f;
  }

  .briefing-decision-icon {
    display: grid;
    place-items: center;
    width: 36px;
    height: 36px;
    border-radius: 7px;
    background: var(--decision-icon-surface);
    color: var(--decision-ink);
  }

  .briefing-decision p {
    margin-top: 3px;
    color: var(--decision-ink);
    font-size: .8125rem;
    font-weight: 500;
  }

  .briefing-audit {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 8px 16px;
    padding-top: 12px;
    border-top: 1px solid #e4ddd0;
    color: #554c59;
    font-size: .875rem;
    font-weight: 600;
  }

  .briefing-sources {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 4px 12px;
    list-style: none;
    margin: 0;
    padding: 0;
  }

  .briefing-sources li {
    font-weight: 400;
  }

  @media (min-width: 1000px) {
    .briefing-thread {
      grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr));
      row-gap: 16px;
    }
  }
</style>
